From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:30:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 136/151] Find: F3 after Escape moves on; Escape closes the
 find bar before clearing the selection

Find next/previous also steps past a match at the cursor when the last find of
the same query landed there and Escape then cleared its selection; a new query
still finds the match right at the cursor. With the find or Go to line bar
open (Vim bindings off), Escape in the text closes the bar and keeps the
selection; the next Escape clears it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

